{"id":1789590,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-06T17:25:49.718Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/zniFKx1wW2JkizpM5eH7vuJ08n0.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":250000,"genres":[{"id":27,"name":"Horror"},{"id":14,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":878,"name":"Science Fiction"},{"id":53,"name":"Thriller"}],"homepage":"","id":1789590,"imdb_id":"tt48244485","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Mallrooms","overview":"After vanishing from a fog-covered highway at midnight, 11-year-old Daniel awakens alone inside an impossibly vast, reality-warping labyrinth of sterile corporate corridors and an abandoned mid-1990s shopping mall. He quickly discovers he is not alone; he is being actively hunted by The Haunting Creep, a relentless monster searching for humans to kill. Ducking into a defunct store in a desperate bid to escape, Daniel is brutally tackled by the creature. In a harrowing, blood-soaked fight for his life, Daniel barely manages to hold back the monster's jaws before unleashing a fierce, desperate blow to its neck. With the agonizingly wounded entity temporarily disoriented, Daniel breaks away in a frantic sprint, narrowly evading the monster's grasp. He manages to plunge through a reality-shifting portal back to the safety of his home. Covered in blood, safely back but fundamentally broken, Daniel is left to face the horrific aftermath—traumatized forever and diagnosed with severe PTSD.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/f1uf7D8RKRkqNKWQxrFz3R5qNd0.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":306410,"logo_path":null,"name":"K76 Films","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-10-28","revenue":0,"runtime":18,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Mallrooms","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":6389161,"known_for_department":"Creator","name":"Oleg Pihosh","original_name":"Oleg Pihosh","pop